<mxCell id="p1b7" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:24.0px&quot;&gt;· 랙 혼재 → 랙마다 AIStor 수 다름&lt;br&gt;· igp-metric ignore 적용&lt;br&gt;· RD · maximum-paths : NW 확인 대기&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FCFAF7;strokeColor=#A19E9A;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#201E1F;fontSize=19.0;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fontFamily=Noto Sans KR,Noto Sans CJK KR,Malgun Gothic,Apple SD Gothic Neo,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="196" width="420" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p1b8" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:25.0px&quot;&gt;랙별 몫 불균등&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#CC501A;strokeColor=#CC501A;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=20.0;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fontFamily=Noto Sans KR,Noto Sans CJK KR,Malgun Gothic,Apple SD Gothic Neo,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="360" width="420" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
