<mxCell id="p6b27" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:25.0px&quot;&gt;동작&lt;br&gt;· 노드마다 VIP /32 를 leaf 와 eBGP 로 광고 (2세션)&lt;br&gt;· leaf 가 랙 노드 M개로 ECMP&lt;br&gt;· 노드 장애 = 세션 down → 경로 제거 (hold 9s)&lt;br&gt;· 그 위에서 Maglev 가 전체 AIStor Pod 로 분배&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#D9DECF;strokeColor=#5F8B5A;strokeWidth=2.5;fontColor=#201E1F;fontSize=20.0;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fontFamily=Noto Sans KR,Noto Sans CJK KR,Malgun Gothic,Apple SD Gothic Neo,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="730" y="500" width="620" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p6b28" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:21.5px&quot;&gt;확인&lt;br&gt;kubectl get ciliumbgpadvertisement -o yaml&lt;br&gt;cilium bgp routes advertised ipv4 unicast&lt;br&gt;show ip route &amp;lt;VIP&amp;gt;/32 vrf PUBLIC   (next-hop = 랙 노드 수)&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EFE3C6;strokeColor=#D4A941;strokeWidth=2.5;fontColor=#201E1F;fontSize=16.5;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontFamily=Noto Sans KR,Noto Sans CJK KR,Malgun Gothic,Apple SD Gothic Neo,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="730" y="666" width="620" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
