<mxCell id="p9b1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:29.0px&quot;&gt;그림 3-1. ECMP 멤버 제거 시 재해시 : 일반 해시 → resilient hashing&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#201E1F;strokeColor=#201E1F;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#F7F3EC;fontSize=24.0;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fontFamily=Noto Sans KR,Noto Sans CJK KR,Malgun Gothic,Apple SD Gothic Neo,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="14" width="1360" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p9b2" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:22.0px&quot;&gt;노드 3 이 빠질 때 일반 해시는 살아 있는 노드로 가던 흐름까지 섞음. resilient 는 빠진 노드 몫만 옮김 (NW 적용 예정)&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ECDDB9;strokeColor=#D4A941;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#201E1F;fontSize=17.0;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fontFamily=Noto Sans KR,Noto Sans CJK KR,Malgun Gothic,Apple SD Gothic Neo,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="62" width="1360" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p9b3" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:22.0px&quot;&gt;I Lake : 일반 해시 (확인 후 결정)&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#969390;strokeWidth=1.2;fontColor=#201E1F;fontSize=17.0;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontFamily=Noto Sans KR,Noto Sans CJK KR,Malgun Gothic,Apple SD Gothic Neo,sans-serif;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="104" width="660" height="630" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p9b4" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:22.0px&quot;&gt;해시 버킷 8개 → 담당 노드 (멤버 4개 : 노드 1 ~ 4)&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FCFAF7;strokeColor=#A19E9A;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#201E1F;fontSize=17.0;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fontFamily=Noto Sans KR,Noto Sans CJK KR,Malgun Gothic,Apple SD Gothic Neo,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="140" width="620" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
