<mxCell id="p18b9" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:25.0px;font-weight:bold&quot;&gt;코어 48 ~ 95&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;border-top:1px solid #A19E9A;margin:0 auto;height:0;width:230px&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:25.0px;padding-top:20px&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=cube;size=10;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;darkOpacity=0.05;darkOpacity2=0.12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E8E4DE;strokeColor=#A19E9A;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#201E1F;fontSize=20.0;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=2;fontFamily=Noto Sans KR,Noto Sans CJK KR,Malgun Gothic,Apple SD Gothic Neo,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="400" y="330" width="240" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p18b10" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:25.0px&quot;&gt;현상&lt;br&gt;· 큐 96 = 전체 코어 → 절반은 원격 NUMA 에서 처리&lt;br&gt;· irqbalance 가 IRQ 를 수시로 옮김&lt;br&gt;· bond 멤버 2개가 서로 다른 NUMA 에 붙음 (n0 · n1)&lt;br&gt;· 고부하에서 rx drop · 지연 편차 원인&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EEEAE4;strokeColor=#B6B3AE;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#201E1F;fontSize=20.0;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontFamily=Noto Sans KR,Noto Sans CJK KR,Malgun Gothic,Apple SD Gothic Neo,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="470" width="620" height="240" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
