<mxCell id="p18b18" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:21.0px&quot;&gt;설정&lt;br&gt;· ethtool -L &amp;lt;nic&amp;gt; combined &amp;lt;로컬 코어 수&amp;gt;&lt;br&gt;· IRQ → /sys/class/net/&amp;lt;nic&amp;gt;/device/local_cpulist 로 고정&lt;br&gt;· irqbalance 에서 NIC IRQ 제외 (또는 중지) · tuned 와 한 방식만&lt;br&gt;· 효과 : 캐시 지역성, 100G 에서 rx drop · 지연 감소&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EFE3C6;strokeColor=#D4A941;strokeWidth=2.5;fontColor=#201E1F;fontSize=16.0;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontFamily=Noto Sans KR,Noto Sans CJK KR,Malgun Gothic,Apple SD Gothic Neo,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="730" y="470" width="620" height="240" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
